### 登录到设备管理员，可以使用设备相关api
POST http://localhost:3003/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "deviceOp",
    "password": "deviceop"
}

### 创建一个新的设备，将上方登录返回的token复制到下方的请求头后面。
POST http://localhost:3003/api/devices
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ1c2VybmFtZSI6ImRldmljZU9wIiwiaWQiOiI2NzA0ZjIzZTRjYjA2MjBjMzkzZGRhZDMiLCJpYXQiOjE3MjkyMzA4MTQsImV4cCI6MTcyOTIzNDQxNH0.qVmn1DbvyCYOjMSLt92y033Dp83eCca1J0vPmrR5B3U

{
    "devicename": "Light",
    "status": "Off"
}

